  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Real-Time Evaluation of the Danida Country Programme for Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To conduct a real-time evaluation of the Danida Country Programme in Kenya 2015-2020. The main focus will be on regular, independent evaluation feed-back on the Theory of Change, especially assumptions and risks, and results at outcome level.</narrative>
  </description>
